-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions based on the work of other authors
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TweetNaCl
  Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen, Tanja Lange,
  Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers - public domain. (Basis of the Ed25519 code.)

OpenBSD bcrypt_pbkdf.c / blf.c
  Ted Unangst, Niels Provos - ISC / BSD licenses. (The bcrypt_pbkdf and
  eksblowfish algorithms were reimplemented after these sources; the Blowfish
  tables, digits of pi, are computed by test/gen_blowfish.py.)

Cryptographic primitives (SHA-2, HMAC, AES, AES-GCM, ChaCha20, Poly1305, X25519,
ECDH, RSA/ECDSA verification, random numbers) come from XelSSL (MIT, Xelitan).
